Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, this is unbelievable!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.02,0:00:06.00,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\an3\fs30\bord0\shad0\pos(608,305)}20:38 Shibuya Hikarie B3F
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.27,0:00:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.67,0:00:05.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What has this happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.85,0:00:07.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I've got to kill someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.33,0:00:18.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this is awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.73,0:00:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently there's another\Nveil centered underneath here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.59,0:00:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this one also traps\Nnon-sorcerous inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, pardon me. Coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.37,0:00:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.29,0:00:45.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I have a good\Nidea what they're after.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.37,0:00:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll play along.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.13,0:00:53.88,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\an1\fs30\bord0\shad0\pos(32,305)}20:39 Aoyama Cemetery
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.87,0:00:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're making Gojo do\Nthis all by himself?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.92,0:00:53.88,Main,Yuji,0,0,0,,{\an8}They're making Gojo-sensei do this alone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.09,0:00:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand the logic, but there has to\Nbe something we can do to help him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.47,0:01:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be his backup or something, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.85,0:01:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and they agree with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.97,0:01:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why we're heading to Shibuya now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.63,0:01:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay, then give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.81,0:01:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.95,0:01:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.33,0:01:17.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't believe they're actually\Nforcing my sister to be his backup?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.69,0:01:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Satoru Gojo thinks he's\Nsome kind of big shot or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.25,0:01:25.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is a big shot So you shouldn't just treat\Nhim like he's an ordinary guy You know,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.95,0:01:30.46,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\an8\c&H121617&\3c&H727678&\bord1\shad0\move(316,58,290,58)}Some Ordinary Guy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.71,0:01:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're not like any ordinary\Nwoman yourself, big sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.97,0:01:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, oui oui.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.19,0:01:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are truly adorable,\Nand that's why I love you.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.21,0:01:35.55,Main,Ui,0,0,0,,{\an8}There you go saying stuff \Nyou don't believe again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.39,0:01:35.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you go, saying\Nstuff you don't believe.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.63,0:01:41.10,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fnArial\b1\an1\fs20\bord0\shad0\fscx85\q2\pos(32,250)}Team Mei Mei\h\hMei Mei (Grade 1 Jujutsu Sorcerer)\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hUi Ui\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hYuji Itadori (Promotion Evaluation Postponed)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.49,0:01:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you don't really love your\Nfamily members, isn't that right?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.55,0:01:41.10,Main,Ui,0,0,0,,{\an8}What you love isn't family, but work \Nrelations treated as family relations, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.31,0:01:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just love that I'm helping\Nyou out with your work right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.37,0:01:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really do get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.11,0:01:47.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the part of you I\Nlove the best. Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.11,0:01:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we just get back to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.67,0:01:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Mei Mei here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.75,0:01:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.27,0:01:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Itadori, we have a change in plans. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.49,0:02:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another veil like the one over Shibuya\Nwas lowered over Meiji Shrine Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.75,0:02:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're heading to that one instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.11,0:02:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're running there, so try to keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.81,0:02:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bet!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.13,0:02:20.13,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,525)\fnArial\b1\an1\fs30\bord0\shad0\pos(182,250)}20:40\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h{\fs22}Tokyo Metro, Shibuya Station\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hB5F, Shin-toshin Line Platform
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.13,0:02:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see that you're all fully prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.75,0:02:30.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really came!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.61,0:02:33.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't have any excuses left!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.37,0:02:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you lose this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.43,0:02:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And have you given any thought?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.43,0:02:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the first excuse you'll use?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.21,0:02:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you get beaten by the three of us!
