Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.13,0:04:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And within that veil,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.47,0:04:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's another veil\Ncentered around the platform,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.67,0:04:25.68,Main,Assistant Supervisor,0,0,0,,{\an8}on level B5 that prevents \Nsorcerers from entering.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.75,0:04:25.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on level B5 that prevents\Nsorcerers from entering.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.11,0:04:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We believe the cursed spirit\Nor cursed user who lowered
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.25,0:04:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these veils is located\Nsomewhere between these two.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.21,0:04:34.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Between them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.55,0:04:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not on the platform\Nthey're centered around?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.97,0:04:39.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.15,0:04:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every time they go outside the\NVeil, they're taking on a risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.65,0:04:44.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only way for them to keep\Ntheir barrier fully strengthened.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.65,0:04:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two of our assistant supervisors\Nhave already been taken out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.51,0:04:50.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In addition, between these barriers...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.33,0:04:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.89,0:04:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still just a guess, and\Nwe really can't be certain yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.41,0:04:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's fine, say it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.09,0:04:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might be helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.55,0:05:04.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are transfigured humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.73,0:05:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Between the barriers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.31,0:05:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you two doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.75,0:05:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.05,0:05:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.96,0:05:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you see that my sister is\Ncurrently sharing the crows' perception?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.17,0:05:41.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a process that takes\Nconcentration, so be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.95,0:05:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.21,0:05:44.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't mind if you talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.69,0:05:45.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She says it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.69,0:05:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.60,0:05:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you always contradict me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.99,0:05:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.90,0:05:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got the gist of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.55,0:05:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Itadori, which would you prefer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.05,0:06:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,killing lots of weak,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.25,0:06:03.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,transfigured humans, or exercising\None powerful, cursed spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.19,0:06:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knowing you, it's probably the latter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.45,0:06:14.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.59,0:06:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It shows the underground station.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.17,0:06:18.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The transfigured humans are milling around
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.37,0:06:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and attacking normal\Npeople here on level B4.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.09,0:06:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The majority of the normal people are\Nprobably at the train platform on level B5.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.61,0:06:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.61,0:06:32.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the crows that I use are\Nimbued with cursed energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.71,0:06:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they couldn't enter level B5.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.09,0:06:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing they're forcing\Nnormal people to flee to level B5,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.91,0:06:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thus serving them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.77,0:06:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, my crows got hunted down\Nhere, between levels B1 and B2.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.49,0:06:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is likely where the cursed spirit or
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.83,0:06:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cursed user who lowered\Nthe veil is hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.89,0:06:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're planning to hunt down\Nany humans that come back up to B4.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.29,0:06:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it has to do with\Nthe Vale's conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.95,0:06:59.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not clear to me yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.01,0:07:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why choose this positioning,\Nand why isolate Level B5?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.85,0:07:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's here, though, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.93,0:07:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's standing down below us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.51,0:07:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.69,0:07:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.60,0:07:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My crows all got killed before they could
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.09,0:07:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,confirm if the curse\Nthey saw was Patchface.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.65,0:07:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, the presence of transfigured\Nhumans would suggest that it's likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.09,0:07:26.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure about\Ndividing up our forces,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.73,0:07:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if we keep wasting time, all the\Ncommon people on B4 will be wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.93,0:07:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two of us will take\NExit 7 directly to B4.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.53,0:07:38.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll rescue the civilians\Nstill on that level.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.25,0:07:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it gets too dangerous, you\Nhead down there as well, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.35,0:07:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though, if I can be greedy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.17,0:07:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope that by the time we reunite with\Neach other, the veil will be lifted,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.55,0:07:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the civilians will be freed?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.75,0:07:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we'll finally figure out exactly\Nwhat our opponents on level B5 are after.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.53,0:07:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me, Mei Mei.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.06,0:08:02.18,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\an8\fs26\bord0\shad0\pos(320,225)}21:03 Tokyo Metro, Meiji Shrine Station, B2F
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.49,0:07:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't lose anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.11,0:08:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.21,0:08:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.37,0:08:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gonna stop staring while I eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.41,0:08:24.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.59,0:08:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're one of those...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.75,0:08:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jujutsu...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.89,0:08:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo Genie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.51,0:08:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.57,0:08:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jujutsu Sorcerer, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.07,0:08:34.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jujutsu Sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.45,0:08:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.69,0:08:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.67,0:08:37.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.11,0:08:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know the Patchface's cursed\Nspirit is around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.27,0:08:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.61,0:08:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patchface?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.52,0:08:46.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patchface?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.44,0:08:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't recall the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.35,0:08:50.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's the one with\Nstitches all over his face
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.75,0:08:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't insult me i know\Nthat much don't forget
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.91,0:08:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm clever mahito is\Nbelow he told me to stay
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.61,0:09:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here and make sure that i protect the veil
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.69,0:09:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mahito? Hmm, I think\NJunpei called him that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.81,0:09:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too whatever its name\Ndoesn't matter right now
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.83,0:09:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,barriers are pretty complicated\Naren't they there are plenty
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.95,0:09:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of people who are strong but\Nstill can't do them although
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.83,0:09:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm both strong and capable\Nthis thing is responsible for
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.69,0:09:25.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the veil both of them doesn't\Nseem likely mahito sorcery
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.35,0:09:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is very bad very very bad he\Ndid say that he was here to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.51,0:09:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,make sure he protects the veil\Nwhich makes that object very
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.05,0:09:38.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,suspicious. I'll smash it for\Nstarters. Did you know? A human's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.67,0:09:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mahito transfigures lose\Ntheir flavor quicker than gum
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.03,0:09:45.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell the difference so easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.79,0:09:47.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because I'm so clever!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.53,0:09:58.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of hearing\Nhow clever this guy is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.23,0:10:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you curses need to stop\Nunderestimating humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.29,0:10:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it, you're not clever, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.83,0:10:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me ask you something: you\Ndon't know what curse I am! Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.99,0:10:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well? Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.91,0:10:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.31,0:10:27.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The not so clever ones in this\Nworld are always the first to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.43,0:10:28.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.87,0:10:30.00,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fs12\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&H152C35&\3c&HB1C1CC&\bord1\shad0\move(475,80,481,73)}You look just like one
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.41,0:10:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a grasshopper curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.37,0:10:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy is clever!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.26,0:10:49.06,Show_Title,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\fad(1350,0)\1c&H75EFED&\3c&H75EFED&\blur20\1a&HE0&\3a&HC0&\pos(320,18)}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.26,0:10:49.06,Show_Title,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\fad(1350,0)\1a&HFF&\3c&HC5E3EC&\pos(320,18)}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.27,0:10:54.06,Show_Title,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\fad(675,0)\3c&H1EDDF0&\pos(320,18)\c&H292619&}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.95,0:10:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Locust Plague A large-scale\Ndisaster arising from an
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.13,0:11:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,outbreak of locusts The locusts will\Nconsume not just crops, but paper,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.11,0:11:06.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,clothes, buildings, anything and\Neverything made from plant fibers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.95,0:11:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A locust is required to eat its own weight
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.35,0:11:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in food every day in order to grow bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.85,0:11:15.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So a locust swarm weighing\None ton must consume the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.57,0:11:18.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,equivalent of 2,500 people's\Nworth of food each day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.21,0:11:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The abnormal sounds of chewing fill the\Nair around the swarm all day and night.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.95,0:11:25.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And once the swarm has passed,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.17,0:11:30.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it leaves behind a wasteland covered in\Nthe black fluid secreted by the locusts,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.11,0:11:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,creating a site that is far from tranquil.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.01,0:11:35.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mankind has long feared,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.97,0:11:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hated, and cursed such demonic pests\Nthroughout the course of recorded history.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.59,0:11:49.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an incredible jaw\Nand jumping ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.17,0:11:53.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact that it can understand speech\Nmeans it's decently powerful too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.59,0:12:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.03,0:12:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you do is run away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.17,0:12:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to fight or don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.43,0:12:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He probably doesn't have any\Ntricks he's not showing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.77,0:12:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.13,0:12:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, are you clever?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.21,0:12:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or are you not clever?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.61,0:12:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.67,0:12:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.89,0:12:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.63,0:13:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clever people don't go around\Ncalling themselves clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.83,0:13:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why wouldn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.37,0:13:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to go fist to fist, you with\Nyour two arms, this is my war!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.09,0:13:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My arms, my jaw, and my eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.93,0:13:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all superior to those of humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.83,0:14:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why is this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.47,0:14:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I the only one getting hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.85,0:14:39.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even with that, I'm still the more clever\None. Locusts lay their eggs underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.15,0:14:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To facilitate this they're capable\Nof extending their abdomens
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.53,0:14:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tips of which are hard to\Nnearly three times their normal life
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.71,0:14:51.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more clever one wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.11,0:14:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did have a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.85,0:15:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But more importantly...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.91,0:15:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.17,0:15:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've eaten people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.77,0:15:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're prepared for\Nwhat that means, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.53,0:15:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was a gap in their strength\Nthat no trick could overcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.51,0:15:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mei Mei?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.57,0:15:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.48,0:15:23.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The veil is lifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.51,0:15:26.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's wait for Itadori,\Nand then descend to B5.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:30.59,0:15:36.10,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\an1\fs30\bord0\shad0\pos(142,250)}21:14\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h{\fs24}Tokyo Metro, Meiji Shrine Station\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hB5F Shin-toshin Line Platform
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.05,0:15:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kogai was exorcised, I guess.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.26,0:15:33.68,Main,Mahito,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ko-guy was exorcised, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.59,0:15:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means a skilled sorcerer is here.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.68,0:15:36.10,Main,Mahito,0,0,0,,{\an8}That means a skilled sorcerer is here.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:36.10,0:15:41.85,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\an8\c&H455051&\3c&HF1FFFF&\shad0}Meiji Shrine (Harajuku)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.43,0:15:38.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.49,0:15:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to fight them too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.17,0:15:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's not going to happen now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.39,0:15:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got a job to do.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:49.86,0:15:52.36,Main,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\an1\fs30\bord0\shad0\pos(48,305)}21:15\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h{\fs24}Tokyo Metro, Meiji Shrine Station B4F
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.44,0:15:52.36,Main,Mei,0,0,0,,{\an8}Impressive, Itadori-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.23,0:16:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.14,0:16:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just accept it with grace!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.06,0:16:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.97,0:16:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so honored!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.17,0:16:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess we're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.45,0:16:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.36,0:16:28.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sitting down over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.29,0:16:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.20,0:16:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.47,0:16:41.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need to do all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.05,0:16:42.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.05,0:16:45.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, if I tried running away,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.11,0:16:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing You guys would\Nkill every human in here, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:50.96,0:16:52.46,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs18\shad0\c&H000000&\3c&HCED5DB&}That's the whole reason\NI came here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.13,0:16:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what are those two\Ntalking about down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.85,0:16:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you mean four?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.15,0:16:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would we kill them then?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.75,0:17:00.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.75,0:17:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand what\Nwill happen when Satoru
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.31,0:17:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gojo is able to utilize\Nhis power to the fullest?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.95,0:17:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit with the build-up and just say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.29,0:17:13.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.09,0:17:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It gets interesting when he's alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.29,0:17:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The correct answer is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.81,0:17:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether you run or not!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.77,0:17:33.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back, folks, or you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.89,0:17:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.80,0:17:38.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they sealed the exit off\Nearlier to create a blind spot so
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.34,0:17:41.10,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&H1D1D19&\3c&HB8BBB3&\shad0\frz359.7\pos(76,115.334)}Bang
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.34,0:17:41.10,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&H1D1D19&\3c&HB8BBB3&\shad0\fs17\frz3.858\pos(88,284.667)}Can't Break It
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.34,0:17:41.10,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&H1D1D19&\3c&HB8BBB3&\shad0\fs17\frz3.858\fs12\pos(168,74.667)}Eek!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.61,0:17:41.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't know if there were\Npeople on the other side or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.83,0:17:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any Jujutsu Sorcerer with him is\Nbasically just a hindrance to his actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.61,0:17:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we'll go one step lower and completely\Nsurround him with non-sorcerers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.79,0:18:10.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blood manipulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.27,0:18:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slicing exorcism.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.61,0:18:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The minimum output of his curse technique
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.81,0:18:38.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,reversal is double that\Nof his amplification.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.89,0:18:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be nearly impossible for him to use
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.01,0:18:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it without catching\Nnon-sorcerers in it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.67,0:18:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He probably won't be able to charge his\Nblue up to an effective output either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.03,0:18:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should prove difficult for him to use\Nblue for high-speed movement as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.13,0:18:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would make him a dump truck as\Nfar as non-sorcerers are concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.75,0:19:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get hit, and it's instant death.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.57,0:19:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So in that situation, Satoru Gojo will\Nhave to focus his energy on defense.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.02,0:19:11.94,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(209.333,198.667)\fnComic Sans MS\c&H975B87&\3c&HCCB2AD&\shad0\b1\fs16}Hmph
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.35,0:19:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Domain amplification!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.73,0:19:47.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes sense for you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.79,0:19:51.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose you would think of that\Nafter allying with Curse users.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.43,0:19:52.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Domain amplification.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.09,0:19:56.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the same principle as the\Nnew Shadow School Simple Domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.45,0:19:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They envelop themselves\Nwith the domain. Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.29,0:20:01.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that reduces its guaranteed hit effect and
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.55,0:20:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ensures they neutralize\Nany technique used.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.85,0:20:10.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they pulled it off right, it\Nwould allow their attacks to hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.33,0:20:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do about his\Ndomain, Infinite Void?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.21,0:20:19.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only ones unaffected by Infinite\NVoid are Satoru Gojo himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.17,0:20:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,along with anyone he touches.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.61,0:20:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even then,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.65,0:20:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if he does have the skill\Nto selectively trap each of
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.31,0:20:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you inside one of his powerful\Ninfinite void domains,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.43,0:20:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A great number of non-sorcerers\Nwould get crushed.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:29.93,0:20:35.19,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\c&H3A403E&\3c&HE7EFE9&\shad0\pos(110.667,30.667)}Veil
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.29,0:20:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,death in the space left between\Nhis domain and the Veil.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:32.31,0:20:35.19,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,0)\pos(506.667,191.333)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&H000000&\3c&HFCF4F5&\bord1\shad0\blur1\frz301.8}Infinite Void
Dialogue: 2,0:20:32.31,0:20:35.19,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,0)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&H221DDC&\3c&HFCF4F5&\bord1\shad0\blur1\pos(521.333,106.667)\frz310.3}Ack!
Dialogue: 2,0:20:32.31,0:20:35.19,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(125,0)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&H221DDC&\3c&HFCF4F5&\bord1\shad0\blur1\frz46.97\pos(172,137.333)}Ack!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.31,0:20:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would give it a 99 % chance he\Nwon't use his domain against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.63,0:20:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that means you mustn't\Nuse your domains either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.35,0:20:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you draw a large mass of\Nnon-sorcerers into your domain,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.93,0:20:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he'll be forced to give up on\Nthem, and then he'll use his too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.27,0:20:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you already know that\Nyou can't win a tug-of-war of
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.57,0:21:00.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,domains with him. At any rate,\Nyou just need to get Satoru Gojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.65,0:21:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to focus focus on defeating\Ncursed spirits and rescuing non
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.91,0:21:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-sorcerers are
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.37,0:21:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you okay come
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.21,0:21:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on now try to keep it together
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.65,0:21:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think you're hurt
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.59,0:21:18.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, take my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.21,0:21:25.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought that we agreed\Nyou wouldn't run away
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.33,0:21:30.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I keep killing to\Nmake you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.19,0:21:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, honestly, I'm actually\Nshocked Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.19,0:21:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here come the excuses
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.51,0:21:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not at all, Blood
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.39,0:21:49.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm saying I'm actually\Nshocked you would ever
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.17,0:21:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have thought you could beat\Nme with this loser shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.35,0:21:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to hold out for\Nat least 20 minutes or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.69,0:22:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that, it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.17,0:22:05.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's when I'll unleash\Nthe prison realm on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.07,0:22:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.39,0:22:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to choose the right world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.45,0:22:47.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's easy to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.63,0:22:51.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make a good place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.99,0:22:58.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't have anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.07,0:23:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.98,0:23:02.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.90,0:23:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.15,0:23:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, keep it on the key to the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.75,0:23:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world is still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.97,0:23:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just be by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.35,0:23:32.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm living more than once.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.09,0:23:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Yamanote Line Game, and\Nthe topic is Gojo's Good Qualities!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.49,0:23:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.77,0:23:45.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strong! Strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.95,0:23:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only strong!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:47.80,0:24:27.88,Next_Ep_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\bord2\blur4}Next Episode\N{\fs30\fscy150}Shibuya Incident - Gate, Open
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.87,0:23:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, Shibuya Incident, gate open.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.09,0:23:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.15,0:23:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, you're such a jokester!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.29,0:23:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, she ain't lying.

